{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "f64ba2cfcc7be48aecc4d84fc1af06cc44c1db9e49ce80e0edaf2ee13625621c", "ja": "What's 青春？", "zh": "What's 青春？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3f6469da2e1b04145f13c8e8f457c26ec38f347aecd41b8b82361846579ac88b", "ja": "プロデューサーから青春についての宿題を\n出されたエレナと美也。通りかかった麗花と\nあずさに、高校時代の話を聞く。2人から\n「楽しんで」というアドバイスを受け、\n「一緒に楽しいことをしよう」と決める。", "zh": "艾琳娜和美也从制作人那接下了\n青春这道课题。她们向路过的丽花跟梓\n问了高中时代的点滴。\n她们参考两人给的建议「享受当下」，\n决定「一起做开心的事情」。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2309de42fba09eb24ff1bf77fb14bfaef342580ed9fce45ed9ef81237b45c4fd", "ja": "（今度のユニットは『爽やかな春の風』という\nテーマから、メンバーはエレナと美也に決まった）", "zh": "（这次由于题目是『爽朗春风』，\n团体的成员就决定是艾琳娜和美也了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "a9416830366a3392214aa60ed23d80aac913c78ccf98d0b3bba2a4db8409736b", "ja": "ねえ{$P$}。\nユニットを組むってことは、もちろん歌うんだよネ？", "zh": "欸，{$P$}。\n我们既然组了团体，当然会唱歌对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "8c45d2efeda9ac2514ef7670b134d6f9c798c7a6655c91bc228acbf83929ee76", "ja": "私達、どんな歌を歌うんでしょうか～？", "zh": "我们要唱怎样的歌曲呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "0bc8745f73b0b6a50dcc7a5e91ef053d5035abacb373ec92e8a076a6b22ae15b", "ja": "その事なんだけど……よかったら、ふたりにも\nアイディアを出してもらえないかと思ってるんだ。", "zh": "关于这件事……方便的话，\n我也想问问你们有没有什么想法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "f61083179a7bc8c08f424909ac1ac6f4d9305ed6430ee09e588d34f63c353b5b", "ja": "なんと～。いいんですか～？", "zh": "什么～可以吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "21c4303c6956613a199b499bc4bd1eb77ad2bd5ff64baacb167d558a08884372", "ja": "ああ。何といっても、美也とエレナは\n現役の女子高生だからな！", "zh": "当然，毕竟美也跟艾琳娜\n可是现役女高中生呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "5b4b4d2abdc5ca95bb3a630a449d334c9500e74b29c9940fecff6ceb5cdea875", "ja": "『爽やかな春の風』を感じさせる、『青春』……\nそのイメージで、歌う曲について考えてきてほしい。", "zh": "给人『爽朗春风』感的『青春』……\n希望你们可以就这个意象去思考想唱的曲子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "39dc31e3df87a4687978db98e9a988fbb24f7b16bfc10e8d0486384d26f4fc9d", "ja": "うん、わかったヨ！\n{$P$}からの宿題ダネ？", "zh": "嗯，我知道了！\n这是{$P$}给我们的功课对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "726c9d9db609f94e2b53e4682d070bf4272ec7a47c4124023ab8c42113c9ab83", "ja": "毎日こんな宿題なら、楽しいのにナ～。\nね、ミヤ。", "zh": "如果每天都是写这种功课，会有多开心啊～\n对不对，美也。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "93bb01c2565921c9d3b611662b7a2e7ab15521e8ab4b5026eb7edfec0e9dc4c4", "ja": "そうですね～。", "zh": "没错呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1010_p", "source_sha256": "13969d3d696d5a880441f19b64488fcc48015abeb9895e362370b61c23be766a", "ja": "学校の宿題やテストなんかもあって大変だと思うけど。\nふたりとも、よろしくな！", "zh": "还要兼顾学校的作业跟考试，我想应该很辛苦。\n不过就交给你们俩啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "781175bfc484429f025e6375380c191d6a99fbcc1fc364c54a0533233edf012b", "ja": "ハーイッ♪", "zh": "好的──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "83f053003249ed34a15a282b8876851cc82a60a80bb9a12e0bf33028b1d42405", "ja": "はい～♪", "zh": "好的～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "da7a080740a91415420321519d8a4d887ff825a7a1f37575d77e4175fc223692", "ja": "ワタシ達ふたりのユニットかぁ……エヘヘ♪\n楽しみだネ、ミヤ！", "zh": "我们两个人的团体啊……嘿嘿♪\n真让人期待呢，美也！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1014_042miy", "source_sha256": "980c1f072aa4d54d02b85957ee224b876ec6f1e7543a00da7c5c4d08a77d6275", "ja": "はい～。{$P$}さんから、\n宿題ももらいましたし～。", "zh": "对啊～{$P$}先生也出了\n功课给我们～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "8c4f5cd6537a039f7a7dafcb979c8ae632e39581e0d0892bb86e916621c08f1d", "ja": "青春かー、青春……。ンー……。\n青春の歌って、どんなカンジなのかナ？", "zh": "青春啊──青春……嗯……\n怎样的歌听起来会有青春的感觉啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "ab8c4e6112ceef4f482d7f13b57134e245d4f9b11525e4df5db114641017f055", "ja": "{$P$}、『女子高生』とも\n言ってたよネ。なら、学校のコトを歌えばいいのかナ？", "zh": "{$P$}也说了『女高中生』对吧。\n那是不是唱学校的事情就好了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1017_042miy", "source_sha256": "1933927f00b1067a02f3e3afe8a8cc9e043146af463b409c409d0721b341e615", "ja": "そうですね～……でも学校のことって、\n歌って、楽しいんでしょうか～？", "zh": "好像有道理……不过，把在学校发生的事唱出来，\n会让人觉得有趣吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "7dc3b34cd4a2fe293d4a95ca893fadad821d82ef31ccc19ececfb013862fbef9", "ja": "うーん。テスト勉強の歌とか、楽しくないヨー。", "zh": "嗯……如果是唱复习考试的歌，那肯定一点也不好玩～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1019_042miy", "source_sha256": "624a57632d9a6554cddbe3609867ab4a6bfa3a76a7416dc5068e8e980d27c422", "ja": "ふふ、そうですよね～。\n学校以外のことでは、青春にならないんでしょうか～？", "zh": "呵呵，就是说啊～\n除了学校，有没有办法找到其他青春的元素呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1020_042miy", "source_sha256": "a6cd4b71c39b9763a242f981bfb96cae3f3f74d72e6110fbde0d8e99d279cdf8", "ja": "エレナさんは、学校以外では、\nいつもどんなことをしているんですか～？", "zh": "艾琳娜没有上学的时候，\n平常都在做些什么～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1021_018ele", "source_sha256": "d365a8aef36287197348703f0f5b17286a4285e7535f37c4bf0d93d5c00d567e", "ja": "学校以外で？　ワタシは……友達と遊んだり、\nダンスしたり……ママンと、料理したりしてるヨ♪", "zh": "没有上学的时候？我……都在跟朋友玩、\n跳舞……或是跟妈妈一起下厨喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1022_042miy", "source_sha256": "42d6b873c5f1441198a7649bc476745f7a1416f7d49eff7df52dbca3a7e54040", "ja": "エレナさんは、お料理が好きなんですね～。\n私も、けっこうやるんですよ～。ふふふ。", "zh": "艾琳娜真的很喜欢做菜呢～\n我在这方面也有点心得喔～呵呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1023_018ele", "source_sha256": "c5cf9b1860e40e3b2f6ab9a62181522f3f7c7996221ceadcc183a19bc261d147", "ja": "そうなの？　ミヤは何が得意？\nワタシがよく作るのはね、ムケッカでしょ……。", "zh": "真的吗？美也的拿手菜是什么？\n我常常做的是巴西炖鱼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1024_048rei", "source_sha256": "9d06cacbf59404b3a4df30fb7e86cc29f7195634095b99420aa701f74ab87cdc", "ja": "あっ！　エレナちゃんと美也ちゃん発見♪", "zh": "啊！是小艾琳娜跟小美也♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1025_010azu", "source_sha256": "ee308eba3ef75cd297bc0e5f8d13fa48ce2375d91b810a7fbc6c5d2046c613eb", "ja": "あら、本当……。\nふたりとも楽しそうだけど、何のお話？", "zh": "哎呀，真的是你们……\n看你们好像很开心的样子，在聊什么呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1026_018ele", "source_sha256": "3904ad20a52d45972257cfa36b506ff6e18ef645b78e25cf1482fb9ce8bc2b8f", "ja": "アズサ、レイカ！　ちょうどいいところに来たヨ～。\nふたりにも、話聞かせて欲しいナ。", "zh": "梓、丽花！你们来得正好～\n我们也想问问你们的意见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1027_048rei", "source_sha256": "b0f2594d13fa8417d1e2c57269c39648284992802491d9d193c88174ed15c7af", "ja": "うん、いいよ♪\nあっ、でも何の話かわからないけど♪", "zh": "嗯，好啊♪\n啊，但我不晓得你要问什么就是了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1028_042miy", "source_sha256": "a65d35a5a1cf16b0f0350017964e41fed760c640d39b0c7f164c889abc7f8716", "ja": "実は今度、私達ふたりで、\nユニットを組むことになりまして～。", "zh": "其实我们两个，\n这次要组成团体了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1029_010azu", "source_sha256": "9027e704337c4bbc453632ee7e29c97cef0ec1785fdaf2b1d4cc1c02927d10dc", "ja": "まぁ、そうなの？　おめでとう、ふたりとも！\nどんなユニットになるのか、今から楽しみね。", "zh": "哇，真的吗？恭喜你们！\n我已经开始期待你们会是怎样的团体了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1030_018ele", "source_sha256": "9d167afec6e95b8d8ed75053acb69103939636dd92754e5530baa7f93c1188e6", "ja": "ウン！　それでネ、{$P$}から\n宿題をもらったんだヨ。", "zh": "嗯！然后呀，\n{$P$}出了一个功课给我们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1031_042miy", "source_sha256": "da73d4643c71d2f50ef386ab7c35695afbc33d3dae9afaaa5d02faf447a59be2", "ja": "私達のユニットは、『爽やかな優しい風』がテーマの、\n青春ユニットなんだそうです～。", "zh": "我们的团体，好像是以『爽朗柔和的风』\n为主题的青春团体～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1032_018ele", "source_sha256": "bbb09cc0ffada28a8d5d2ec7e88d4a2071fabfe80d6b0350650ebc50fd34f04c", "ja": "だからどんなコトが青春っぽいか、考えてきて！\nって言われたんだヨ。", "zh": "所以制作人要我们思考，\n什么事情会让人感到青春洋溢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1033_042miy", "source_sha256": "8f13b284e58ee0034e41a37ea4359b73edf9e15ac9187c8c0c30aa5b0bb124a2", "ja": "でも……私達も、どうすれば青春なのか、\nよくわからなくてですね～。", "zh": "可是……我们也不是很懂\n要怎样才会有青春的感觉～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1034_048rei", "source_sha256": "5d68b04c67e0659e9c59114fac96e30ae20968dafbe340a7c2bffe943dc1e8c0", "ja": "ふむふむ、なるほど。\nそれで私達に、質問ってわけだね！", "zh": "嗯嗯，原来是这样。\n所以你们就来问我们了啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1035_042miy", "source_sha256": "5b613d2be205de6a247232c151f04708e77bcfdbdba86b499c999761525523af", "ja": "はい～、そうなんです～。", "zh": "是的～没有错～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1036_010azu", "source_sha256": "c355b20d8d39d1e3c3c29a10139e43d80a441929607982b91c2dc13f288a7e6a", "ja": "確かに……青春を送っている最中には、\nそれが青春だなんて、わからないものよね～。", "zh": "说来也是……正在歌颂青春的人，\n往往不会晓得那就是青春呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1037_018ele", "source_sha256": "02bd7e2ccd88da1b2e095e3be09519b2a5a77213d0b197b08e0e979313b6281f", "ja": "だから、アズサとレイカに質問！\nふたりの青春を教えて！", "zh": "那么，请问梓跟丽花！\n你们度过了怎样的青春？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1038_042miy", "source_sha256": "de01c29c95f94340f246eabee48af7139c327fc7d097afbc92e2eaba8e178c10", "ja": "おふたりは高校生の時、どんな感じだったんですか～？", "zh": "请问你们在高中的时候，过着怎样的生活呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1039_010azu", "source_sha256": "4efd48451bc6ac334f539c29f6c89a446eb40030c5a4382134a87aa80864b1fd", "ja": "高校生の頃……そうねえ。\n麗花ちゃんは、どんな学生さんだったのかしら？", "zh": "还是高中的时候……我想想。\n丽花当时是怎样的学生呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1040_048rei", "source_sha256": "6438304b99ecd09ea945ab61de7c58f3487c8f3ac1b44e3e79989a14743c77fd", "ja": "私ですか？　文化祭とか修学旅行とか、学校の行事を\nとっても楽しみにしている、普通の高校生でしたよ！", "zh": "我吗？是个普通的高中生，每天都很期待文化祭、\n毕业旅行那类的校园活动喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1041_048rei", "source_sha256": "d52bb0ea089ee18f478819a5a8d443efa89e72fd19a9de45e48bc96c84a27405", "ja": "あと、登下校も楽しかったな～。\nタヌキさんと競走したり！", "zh": "还有，上下学的路程也很好玩呢～\n有时候会跟狸猫赛跑喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1042_042miy", "source_sha256": "094cd0c40a604c70f3add3f8ce2cddf9efbada653f38b2897cb80b581ea41296", "ja": "なんと～。\nタヌキさんと競走できるんですか～？", "zh": "什么～\n可以跟狸猫赛跑呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1043_048rei", "source_sha256": "ed5b22ced9a4e478faf628abc92cf081692a9b72379f30782a3d2f9416f38633", "ja": "うんうん！　たま～に、カモシカさんとも\nバッタリ出会っちゃうことがあるんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯嗯！\n偶～尔还会碰巧遇到长鬃山羊，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1044_048rei", "source_sha256": "b001d546a44f99274b907b3a01e2e9e6ce5497b31f8601783ffb1db047e5e17a", "ja": "カモシカさんは恥ずかしがり屋さんだから、\nすぐ隠れちゃうんだよね。懐かしいな♪", "zh": "因为长鬃山羊很害羞，\n所以会马上躲起来。真是怀念♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1045_018ele", "source_sha256": "30631e2e31e9f45101a8e2faafc6dfb7799fdecc339f06b177c4a862e2b5606e", "ja": "ふーん、そっかぁ。\n高校生のレイカも、楽しそうだネ！", "zh": "哦～是这样啊。\n高中时期的丽花好像也过得很快乐呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1046_048rei", "source_sha256": "24a3bc9ba3a8a2875fe1a822cb2ba8123a4cba512c734fa539acdf8bb819bd21", "ja": "そうだね♪\nでも今のほうが、もっと楽しいかな！", "zh": "对啊♪\n但我现在过得更快乐喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1047_042miy", "source_sha256": "e63b3659329d464bf616ab74aeda7fcc4e6b8335813a224bee1790f40c603963", "ja": "あずささんは、どんな高校生活だったんですか～？", "zh": "那阿梓姊高中时有什么回忆吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1048_010azu", "source_sha256": "a2bddae3853b4630431e4cbea1cdb40bbe13001cf965b200465b2f972bec3d32", "ja": "高校生の時？　そうねえ……。私は、先輩に告白\nされて、お付き合いをすることになったんだけど……。", "zh": "高中的时候？这个嘛……有学长跟我告白，\n后来我们开始交往，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1049_018ele", "source_sha256": "80dfe72d809c16faeec461ba90f24aab30141a1c7f91fb24283c4b3dbd19de6f", "ja": "エーッ！？", "zh": "什么──！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1050_042miy", "source_sha256": "3af3cb512ff04ebcd13b839155ca5b62f361badbdc2867df4253739b298965b4", "ja": "おー。恋のお話ですか～。", "zh": "哦～是恋爱的话题呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1051_048rei", "source_sha256": "27941c28fb9ba7ad5727b804699fbcee50778ec5ecc5ac20ceebba9c7c52b98d", "ja": "青春！って感じだね！　それでそれで？\nあずささん、どうなったんですか？", "zh": "真的很有青春的感觉呢！后来呢后来呢？\n梓，后来怎么样了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1052_010azu", "source_sha256": "7eef033810596e59b26f11ec8a67c6b6af216b541c5c2ceadaca83f336b7917c", "ja": "私ったら、とても緊張してしまって……\n一緒に帰ったんだけれど、一言も話せなくて……。", "zh": "我那个时候紧张过头……\n我们虽然一起回家，但路上一句话也没说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1053_010azu", "source_sha256": "deb3a821e70adbe84a633fdd25875ff59b4792a9047dd6ee521919ee6b384fe8", "ja": "結局、先輩とはそれっきりになっちゃったの。\n私の初めてのデートの思い出、かしら。", "zh": "结果从那次之后，我跟学长就没有任何联络了。\n算是我人生第一次约会吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1054_042miy", "source_sha256": "de967f10c50efdf1fe0e2dfbeb1136717188c496c1d384f7b34f465a18b3972c", "ja": "なんと～……。", "zh": "什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1055_010azu", "source_sha256": "a21bf54ac367eda6de6efe69936b8da034d67ad6f2f842ac388282881883873c", "ja": "うふふ。今となっては、笑い話みたいなものだけど……\nその当時は、本当に落ち込んでしまったのよ。", "zh": "呵呵，现在回头来看，虽然有点像在讲笑话……\n但我当时真的非常沮丧呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1056_010azu", "source_sha256": "e2a102e035775cdaaf404771d15ca491b7a980dfabdf8904bd60ac8e9a894324", "ja": "先輩だって、きっと勇気を出して声をかけてくれたのに\n……とっても悪いことをしてしまったわ、って。", "zh": "学长肯定也是鼓起好大的勇气才向我表白的。\n……真的对他很过意不去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1057_018ele", "source_sha256": "d41b0f20e196766043fbed84a7454c0fc2170efd38c1e302d17cc6cf24c35b4b", "ja": "アズサ……。", "zh": "梓……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1058_042miy", "source_sha256": "460a2bb46481e373153cfd9b2b252a5dc13848d0ca8303e4babc1e4f54dbf765", "ja": "む～ん……なんだか、切ないお話ですね……。", "zh": "唔～嗯……真是让人遗憾的故事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1059_048rei", "source_sha256": "867a1f31513210bb3936fb27654d1e59af58b62c364a9f3520a738ca5b5a9f40", "ja": "悲しいけど、あずささんにとっては、\n忘れられない思い出になってるんですね。", "zh": "虽然悲伤，但对梓来说，\n这已经是永生难忘的回忆了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1060_010azu", "source_sha256": "7c514287cf4f54d4e2124d1d86f22037a924cf0847054387e16008d4f777147f", "ja": "ええ、そうなの。思い出す度に、少しほろ苦いけど……\nこれも私にとっては、大切な思い出なのかも。", "zh": "嗯，没有错。虽然每次回想起来都有些苦涩……\n但这份心情也是我重要的回忆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1061_010azu", "source_sha256": "6a636554bc586d74445ea360fd04aef2e9351d80c869b91e3a17f46ab16f44f2", "ja": "次にまた、同じことをしないためにも、ね。", "zh": "同时也警惕我自己，别再犯同样的过错了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1062_018ele", "source_sha256": "54c2671a924ffba01ba2d1a8d773e6379f5ae6aa8667c7e05e22a98386594c3e", "ja": "ほろ苦いのも、青春なノ？\nなんだか難しいナ……。", "zh": "苦涩的心情，也是青春吗？\n真是难懂……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1063_042miy", "source_sha256": "086d8aacc37a82359a49615d8b569ec4089bb01f259e6f4934d599a7041e80d5", "ja": "そうですね……。", "zh": "对啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1064_048rei", "source_sha256": "f1531c543034193939420eeb31e376b34e3b01a3981c1cf798a3d9765ca7235d", "ja": "でもでも、「3年」ってけっこう長いはずなのに、\nなんだかあっという間に卒業しちゃった気がするな。", "zh": "可是可是，「3年」明明很长，\n但总觉得自己好像转眼间就毕业了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1065_010azu", "source_sha256": "28d5cab810615692cd9599db54a2e125126f422baa36c6ee249294463a34d017", "ja": "そうね……いろんなことがあったけど、\n私も、あっという間だったわ。", "zh": "嗯……虽然经历了很多事，\n但我也觉得时间稍纵即逝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1066_010azu", "source_sha256": "9132e04a68c821ac7b8a58e41def5900466c02b1b944455aa7e3a0a34a6d0eba", "ja": "高校生活って、長いようでとっても短いから……\nふたりも、たくさん楽しんで素敵な思い出を作ってね。", "zh": "高中生活，看似漫长却很短暂……\n你们要多去享受当下，留下美好的回忆喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1067_048rei", "source_sha256": "99e2677ad7801cb37ac2c779f9c882f052300bb7f4afd16546840edc069d9a8f", "ja": "うんうん！\nたくさん楽しめたら、きっと素敵だと思うよ♪", "zh": "嗯嗯！\n经历的越多，回想起来一定就越感动♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1068_042miy", "source_sha256": "6dcfc11d8c71d602c4c99fa79aec8cd2a6352f726924bc737bd3ad14427a2678", "ja": "はい～、わかりました～。", "zh": "好～我们知道了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1069_018ele", "source_sha256": "b2e5c1d534fbcc81066cda389c1f1b3b6119925cc03eca14784337d32350822b", "ja": "アズサ、レイカ、ありがとう！", "zh": "梓、丽花，谢谢你们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1070_018ele", "source_sha256": "9c231d96f553617d9f6ec5a64667afa03bc37305bc91c20fb725f848710f8591", "ja": "青春にも、いろいろあるんだネ……。", "zh": "青春也有各式各样的形式呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1071_042miy", "source_sha256": "d7d0b0e3f6c9a0ccfe99c01c7e4815eaa8da869fbc23472f7a75588e84112548", "ja": "そうですね～……。でも、あずささんも麗花さんも、\n『楽しんで』って言ってましたね～。", "zh": "对啊……不过，阿梓姊跟丽花姊\n都有说要『享受当下』呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1072_018ele", "source_sha256": "56d1f79a8b371d3009e928abf1c8cbb38b14682f225787cae2eb74b1deda308d", "ja": "ンー……。\nつまり、青春って、楽しいコトが大事なのカナ？", "zh": "嗯……\n简单来说，青春就是要过得愉快？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1073_042miy", "source_sha256": "cdd1742ff0f8d108a7ecc984605e320caa33e037a9f98388bc05ea4d7563388e", "ja": "なるほど、そうかもしれませんね～。\nでは、私達も……。", "zh": "原来如此，这么说或许没错～\n那么，我们也来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1074_018ele", "source_sha256": "384003af278ca7715646a45d019855e2c0789d2cac4b85da25e5adadf1dd93e0", "ja": "ウン！　ミヤ、ワタシと一緒に、楽しいコトしよっ♪\nそしたら、何かいいアイディアが浮かぶかもだヨ！", "zh": "嗯！美也，跟我一起做好玩的事吧♪\n这样说不定会想到什么好点子喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_02_1075_042miy", "source_sha256": "be1fbfdd62ca6295c8a1e6ec098110d6128cf9dbdb2dceb2ed068a0e8531b16b", "ja": "はい～♪　ではまず私が、エレナさんを楽しいところへ\n案内しますよ～。楽しみにしていてくださいね～。", "zh": "好～♪那么，我先带艾琳娜去一个有趣的地方～\n请你好好期待吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
